    <thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Fits</td><td>iPhone 18 Pro and iPhone 18 Pro Max. Coming to iPhone 18 when it arrives.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Thickness</td><td>4.2 mm on the back, level with the lens tops: +0 mm at the iPhone’s thickest point. A flat back, with only the lenses showing.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Footprint</td><td>71.1 × 149.2 mm, inset 0.4 mm from the phone’s outline and following its edge curve, so it never overhangs</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Housing</td><td>CNC-machined Grade 5 titanium (Ti-6Al-4V), with a ceramic finish: a plasma electrolytic oxide layer grown from the titanium itself, sealed with a colour-matched ceramic topcoat in Burgundy, Glacier, Silver or Black. Or bare solid brass (C26000), which darkens to a natural patina.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Weight</td><td>About 93 g in titanium, 136 g in brass</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Battery</td><td>6.2 Wh, about 5 hours as a node on its own. Extended battery option: about 7.5 Wh, about 6 hours</td></tr>
      <tr><td>USB-C</td><td>NuLink has its own USB-C port in its bottom edge, above the iPhone’s. The iPhone’s port stays open: charge both at once, from two cables or one dual USB-C cable, and keep using the iPhone’s port for drives, displays, audio and CarPlay.</td></tr>
